Please follow those rules:

- Use explicit db_table in all applicable models in esperoj app.
- Create index in Meta class for common queries.
- Use Google style docstring and make sure it will pass the linter test.
- Use best practices.
- Separate of concerns to better refactor later on.
- Add comments like section headers to separate similar fields in large model. Like all relationships in one blocks.
- Create manager for common query on models.
- Create common access function for model especially those that has deep nested relationships. For example, prefetch and fetch related fields. I don't want to remember all related fields.
- Use type hints for related models set.
- Add help text to all model fields.
- Add contraint to databases if applicable.
- Change field type to sensiable max_length.
